{"title":"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Rigorous)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Rigorous)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(Quick_and_Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Orvin went to the store with just enough money to buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> balloons. When he arrived he discovered that the store had a special sale on balloons: buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> balloon at the regular price and get a second at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> off the regular price. What is the greatest number of balloons Orvin could buy?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/eca998dd453c14004d7c51fc4f9134508f3f0e73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 33\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 34\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 38\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Rigorous.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Rigorous)\">Solution 1 (Rigorous)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Rigorous)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us assume that Orvin will buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> balloons at the original price <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> balloons at the discounted price.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a024cb7a632bab164cf885f8c14e990e82975275.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ak+\\frac{2b}{3}k\\leq{30k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/e/c0edd272865887b4a2c19d6983b9adfcad067406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac{2b}{3}\\leq{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><br />\nBecause the number of balloons with discount cannot exceed the number of balloons with the original price, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53cfac491fa6cb74f805f53c6147ec666aec2d55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\leq{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/2/832da40929af0eee37a10472697c9c2811fa4378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+\\frac{2b}{3}\\leq a+\\frac{2b}{3}\\leq{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"172\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57cca51a42d07b001545b8402a0e8a3bb7bd8b75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5b}{3}\\leq{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6ebfd71ce1d842d731b2bdfb5751eed6c780caa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\leq{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/e/bbe65e152d212abbe633ba5b66b9e6c262c7bfcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q=a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> be the total number of balloons Orvin buys.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/a/c2a5fee163372d072e5a374ff90118910d69f96d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac{2b}{3}=Q-\\frac{b}{3}\\leq{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97d50a88e9c6272620bf41b007cbae5d813567d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q\\leq{30+\\frac{b}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><br />\nSubstitute in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6ebfd71ce1d842d731b2bdfb5751eed6c780caa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\leq{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/1/8813dbafac3b4346362d974f797111d9f9bf4de2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q\\leq{30+\\frac{b}{3}}\\leq{30+\\frac{18}{3}}=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"223\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> is indeed attainable. Buying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> balloons at the original price and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> balloons at the discounted price, Orvin will spend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4b16702dbf6b4b1a6f1b41e2eed8da2890d7b4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18k+18\\times{\\frac{2}{3}}k=30k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\" /> dollars. This completes the proof.\n</p><p><br />\nThe answer to the problem is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~G2JFForever\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If every balloon costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> dollars, then Orvin has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c81a4cab3374601fa0488d219772ef2d0f08696.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> dollars.  For every balloon he buys for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> dollars, he can buy another for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05bb4392f23b6656951e63994a2fa0f7da5b1cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2n}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"26\" height=\"38\" /> dollars.  This means it costs him <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/1/0e1bf98ef95680be873cf20cf3945f1f3f3e0b55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5n}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"26\" height=\"38\" /> dollars to buy a bundle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> balloons.  With <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c81a4cab3374601fa0488d219772ef2d0f08696.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> dollars, he can buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/4/c04042309dfe4e155a76d0af96d6373c57df1b6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{30n}{\\frac{5n}{3}} = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"77\" height=\"45\" /> sets of two balloons, so the total number of balloons he can buy is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba74f5e26ac395e7713e28887a641882d02d9b12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18\\times2  \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"164\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Similar to solution 1, but quicker. \nWe see the fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/b/6bbc12fc7cdd6e62d84e41ba09ccad7cd03cad8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac13,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"17\" height=\"37\" /> so we let each balloon cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831d26f39684cd7cfa4ae5f2a0098b432dc8a6ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> WLOG. Thus, Orvin has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/2/27259873795a36f7c8a774081015a4185fb41887.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3\\cdot30=\\$90.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" /> \nEach pair of balloons (one full-priced and one a third off) costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/7/617f5ef83cb54c321878321e6f7e3a21b1ec50d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3+\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\cdot\\$3=\\$3+\\$2=\\$5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"274\" height=\"45\" /> Therefore, Orvin can buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/c/aac141f8e18ebfde6c8ba2f9422c4a9d8637f703.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\$90}{\\$5}=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"41\" /> pairs of balloons, at maximum. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/9/949b6ce7846569bca242b29566a9f27b7db1701e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18\\cdot2=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" /> balloons. \n~Technodoggo\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Quick_and_Easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Quick_and_Easy)\">Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vkItt-jxrIs\">https://youtu.be/vkItt-jxrIs</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B\">2014 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017003500\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 293/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7095/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.809      1 -total\n 60.27%    8.323      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.02%    5.250      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12418:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017003500 and revision id 283755. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}